{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google近日宣佈，正在讓搜索服務變得更加個性化，用户將可以把Google Wallet（Google錢包）連接到搜索中的「個人智能」（Personal Intelligence）AI模式。這項功能旨在幫助用户梳理財務目標、尋找削減開支的方法，並更好地利用信用卡權益。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587726.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.440618+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:21:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"c08f6a62c1d65f89c120aba0d0d7bc902a1d858e0c5c7aae591dfb73008590bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}